<title>BELGIUM: Belgian unemployment fell to 13.4 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Belgian unemployment fell to 13.4 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Employment Ministry released the following unemployment data -</p>
<p>    BELGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	   Feb	  Jan	  Feb 1996</p>
<p>    Total registered jobless (*) 571,560    579,457    604,212</p>
<p>    Total benefit recipients (!) 456,448    462,183    494,682</p>
<p>    Pct of workforce (*)	   13.4	 13.6	 14.3</p>
<p>NOTE - (*) all registered unemployed, whether or not they receive unemployment benefits; (!) excluding those over 55 whom the Office regards as too old for the labour market.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
